{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226470","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422647001:1":{"text":"太好了，谢谢你们，我的鸭子宝贝回来了！","source_cn":"太好了，谢谢你们，我的鸭子宝贝回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247514BA66EC68FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422647002:1":{"text":"自己的鸭子还是要自己看好。本该自己完成的责任交给其他人，就要做好无法完成的准备。","source_cn":"自己的鸭子还是要自己看好。本该自己完成的责任交给其他人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88101B63AE35B53F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422647003:1":{"text":"我明白了，归根结底还是我自己不够上心……","source_cn":"我明白了，归根结底还是我自己不够上心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB7DB9732792C0CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422647004:1":{"text":"我、我也！真的太不好意思了，接受了别人的委托结果却……","source_cn":"我、我也！真的太不好意思了，接受了别人的委托结果却……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A768E86976DFC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422647005:1":{"text":"是，如果想看书，就不要答应人家；既然答应了，就该负起相应责任。","source_cn":"是，如果想看书，就不要答应人家；既然答应了，就该负起相...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30F729EEAEB0B47D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422647006:1":{"text":"自己不愿或无法承担的责任就干脆拒绝，也是一种负责的表现。","source_cn":"自己不愿或无法承担的责任就干脆拒绝，也是一种负责的表现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9324C7C77B3A1DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422647007:0":{"text":"我知道了，以后无论是许诺还是做事，我都会更认真一些……","source_cn":"我知道了，以后无论是许诺还是做事，我都会更认真一些……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74311576B4E84048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422647008:0":{"text":"鸭子……真是奇怪的生物，我还以为会很凶猛，结果只会嘎嘎叫。","source_cn":"鸭子……真是奇怪的生物，我还以为会很凶猛，结果只会嘎嘎叫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56CA74EF6093AE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422647009:0":{"text":"不，有些鸭子也会啄你的屁股，很凶猛的！","source_cn":"不，有些鸭子也会啄你的屁股，很凶猛的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF64D0A59FBF1AE30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422647010:0":{"text":"不过，我还以为那位失职的女性会受到更严厉的处罚。","source_cn":"不过，我还以为那位失职的女性会受到更严厉的处罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9041F89C19353E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422647011:0":{"text":"处罚？你是指？","source_